{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, then take it. If heavy, move it, check temperature, then do task, else scan or approach. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesiredLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectTemperature    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
